        rationale: "Access and egress routes, stairways, and gangways must be kept completely free of tools, materials, debris, and obstructions at all times to ensure safe movement and emergency evacuation."
      },
      {
        id: 3, unit: "U5700.0", skill: "Skill 5700.02 — Identify and Report Hazards",
