        rationale: "Skill 5700.02 requires identifying physical and musculoskeletal hazards. Prolonged exposure to tool vibration damages blood vessels, nerves, and joints in the hands and arms (HAVS)."
      },
      {
        id: 4, unit: "U5700.0", skill: "Skill 5700.02 — Identify and Report Hazards",
